{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"SwiduxPersistence","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPersistence"}],"externalID":"s:17SwiduxPersistence0B11CoordinatorCAA0A00A10ObservableRzrlE12mergeChanges4into6policyyAD5StoreCyxq_G_AA11MergePolicyVSgtYaF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mergeChanges","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC","text":"Store","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"policy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV","text":"MergePolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"mergeChanges(into:policy:)","role":"symbol","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"State","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"SwiduxObservable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]}},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/mergeChanges(into:policy:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencecoordinator\/mergechanges(into:policy:)"]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mergeChanges","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"store","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Store","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"policy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MergePolicy","preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"store","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The live store to reconcile.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"policy","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Narrows the configured policy for this call only.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is what a remote-change observer should call. Where","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)"},{"text":" re-reads every row of every registered entity","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on every tick, this reads the store’s transaction log since the last","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"merge and spends the result through ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/mergeRemote(into:ids:deleted:policy:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"— so a tick on an N-row table where k rows changed costs O(k). A tick with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no transactions behind it costs one history fetch and nothing else.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every guarantee the other two make holds here. Deletions come from history","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tombstones, which are positive evidence, so unlike a full re-hydration this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"can","type":"text"}]},{"text":" remove the last surviving row. Pending local writes and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/editing","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holds still win, and that is not configurable."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"When it re-reads everything instead","anchor":"When-it-re-reads-everything-instead"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The narrow path is an optimisation, never a weakening: anything that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"leaves a window unaccounted for falls back to the full read, and the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fallback keeps its empty-snapshot guard. It happens on the first tick","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after launch or a container rebuild, when the watermark has expired or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"history fetch fails, when a deletion’s tombstone carries no identity"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(every row deleted before "},{"code":"@Attribute(.preserveValueOnDeletion)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" shipped),","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"when a changed row can’t be resolved, and when more than one store sits","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"behind the container."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The watermark advances whenever a tick read every registered entity","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"successfully — including a tick that declined to apply some of what it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read. A row an editing hold defers is carried forward by identity and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"re-offered next tick, which is what keeps a hold from quietly becoming a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"veto without costing a full table read per tick to prevent. See","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doc:HowToAddICloudSync","type":"text"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Both outcomes are reported: ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceDiagnostic\/Kind-swift.struct\/remoteChangesMerged","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"for a narrowed tick, "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceDiagnostic\/Kind-swift.struct\/historyUnavailable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with a reason for a fallback."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Merges only the rows persistent history says changed, falling back to a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"full "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)"},{"type":"text","text":" whenever history can’t answer."}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0}